# .roadmap.cli mk1 — domain SSOT, JSONL entry per line
# Header on next line; entries follow.
{"type":"header","kind":"domain","name":"cli","mk":1,"goal":"anima-agent 단일 진입점 `anima-agent <subcmd>` 라우터 — cli/anima-agent.hexa 가 모든 feature 모듈(status/run/agent/tools/channels/providers/plugins) 로 안정 라우팅; hx install 후 $HX_BIN_DIR/anima-agent shim 동작 보증; raw 9 hexa-only 표면 유지","required_conditions":[{"id":"cli.cond.1","desc":"cli/anima-agent.hexa subcmd 라우터가 hexa.toml [modules] 의 모든 entry(anima_agent, hexa, autonomy_loop, autonomy_live, discovery_loop, dashboard_bridge, ecosystem_bridge, metrics_exporter, philosophy_lenses, consciousness_features, llm_claude_adapter, browser_harness) 로 라우팅 노출","verifier":"","status":"unmet","evidence":[],"blocker_reason":""},{"id":"cli.cond.2","desc":"`hx install anima-agent` post-install hook(install.hexa) 의 cli --self-test PASS — graceful-absent on anima 백엔드 부재","verifier":"","status":"unmet","evidence":[],"blocker_reason":""},{"id":"cli.cond.3","desc":"채널 라우팅 `--channel <cli|telegram|discord|slack|mcp>` 표면 노출 + verifier (anima-agent-channels sister repo 부재 시 cli 단독 동작)","verifier":"","status":"unmet","evidence":[],"blocker_reason":""},{"id":"cli.cond.4","desc":"browser_harness 서브커맨드 노출 — `anima-agent browser probe|invoke|version` 형태로 방금 이관된 모듈을 CLI 표면에서 1-hop 호출 가능","verifier":"","status":"unmet","evidence":[],"blocker_reason":""}],"blockers":[],"status":"active","since":"2026-05-06"}
